<title>UK: May 27-29 Brent cargo kept by Shell - trade.</title>
<headline>May 27-29 Brent cargo kept by Shell - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The sole Brent cargo nominated loading dates on Monday was kept voluntarily ahead of the five o'clock deadline, traders said.</p>
<p>The cargo, due to load May 27-29, was kept by Shell UK, they said.</p>
<p>Brent cargoes are traded on a paper, or forward market until the 1700 London time deadline on the nearest trading day 15 days before their assigned loading date.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7930</p>
